The Chinese forces are in chaos without their main Recycler. We have a golden opportunity to turn this war in our direction. You are to lead an assault on the Chinese base before they can reorganize themselves. You will have as many troops as you need at your disposal. You must cause as much damage as you can as quickly as you can; our plan is to beat the Chinese into submission, hopefully persuading them to surrender.

MISSION OBJECTIVES
 - Set up a field HQ.
 - Kick some Chinese ass!

INTELLIGENCE REPORT:
As you know, the technology being used by the Chinese is a transportation device - Pegasus, the winged horse. Our sources suggest that the far end of this portal is on a planet too far away to be visible from this solar system, which was known to the Ancient Greeks as Elysium. We believe the Chinese have discovered the ruins of a Chthonian city on Elysium, but beyond this, we know nothing of what may be on the other side of the portal, waiting to come through.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
The new Red Devil unit is available for service now. Be careful with them, though - their speed and maneuverability has meant a compromise on armor, and there are still certain issues to be ironed out - remember that the Red Devil is effectively still a prototype model.